# Terraform state and plans (contain secrets and infra IDs)
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.tfplan.json
crash.log
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
override.tf
override.tf.json
**/*_override.tf
**/*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Real variable files (only *.example is committed)
terraform/terraform.tfvars
terraform/*.auto.tfvars
!terraform/*.example

# Ansible secrets and generated inventory
